    {
      "block": "library/10665-68008/blocks/prose-page-001",
      "source": "sections/page-001.md",
      "source_hash": "6f06ba1decbdd0387ed5e26b9b1e233d00dcf6dfb7ef53c4c15c1a0a4d7871b9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The first page of Upper Volta's country report to the 1969 inter-regional seminar on smallpox eradication in Lagos, giving population estimates by age group for 1966 and 1970. It lists the tables and figures that follow on population, smallpox cases and vaccinations, and carries standard WHO distribution notices; the OCR contains some errors.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-68008/blocks/prose-page-002",
      "source": "sections/page-002.md",
      "source_hash": "abac6dfa72d3e920e24377f7059d7ef89bf482fbfcb7ac5b7918c462dc330f36",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Continues the Upper Volta report form, listing tables on smallpox vaccinations, targets and measles data and noting the use of tally sheets and vaccination from six months of age. It gives staffing details, such as team composition, supervisors and the average number of daily vaccinations per team.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-68008/blocks/prose-page-003",
      "source": "sections/page-003.md",
      "source_hash": "3982a1cb3cb0209d62ed0f526ed75dd512199b40e41f4086b413c8c40d75e2d3",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes programme supervision and assessment in Upper Volta, including days supervisors spent checking vaccination teams and steps taken when performance was poor. It notes that about 1% of primary vaccinations in young children were checked for takes, with revaccination when take rates fell below 95%.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-68008/blocks/prose-page-004",
      "source": "sections/page-004.md",
      "source_hash": "0dd23b4f1d0cb3a117c0f166bdcfa741fa8288cc7fd4109a434c593ee2d2d633",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes smallpox surveillance in Upper Volta, including 604 reporting sites, weekly reporting with immediate notification of cases, and help from measles and meningitis programmes and village heads. It notes that a new reporting system covering fixed and mobile centres began in January 1969.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
